ft to live on to such an age that they forget all they once knew. You sometimes see the earth lifeless, yet when We send down water it stirs and swells and produces every kind of joyous growth:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O mankind","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","en_gloss":"O mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsu","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you are","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَيْبٍۢ","en_gloss":"doubt","transliteration":"raybin","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"about","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْبَعْثِ","en_gloss":"the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-baʿthi","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَإِنَّا","en_gloss":"then indeed, We","transliteration":"fa-innā","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَلَقْنَـٰكُم","en_gloss":"We created you","transliteration":"khalaqnākum","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تُرَابٍۢ","en_gloss":"dust","transliteration":"turābin","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":15,"ar":"نُّطْفَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"a semen-drop","transliteration":"nuṭ'fatin","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":18,"ar":"عَلَقَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"a clinging substance","transliteration":"ʿalaqatin","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"22:5"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"